{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"霧子\r\n……お疲れ様","trans":"雾子\n……辛苦了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040030","name":"霧子","text":"──────え、と…………","trans":"──────呃，那个…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040040","name":"霧子","text":"色んなことが……\r\n聴こえました……","trans":"各种各样的事……\n都听见了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040050","name":"霧子","text":"ここだけじゃ……なくて……","trans":"不只是……这里……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040060","name":"霧子","text":"今だけじゃ……なくて……","trans":"不只是……现在……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040090","name":"霧子","text":"歌えたかは……\r\nわからないです……","trans":"有没有唱好……\n我不知道……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004040110","name":"霧子","text":"これが……\r\n歌……なんだなって────","trans":"原来这……\n就是歌啊────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}